  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADD West Africa - Advancing alcohol policies for sustainable development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WAAPA will address alcohol as an obstacle to the realisation of several SDGs and aim to reduce the level of alcohol-related harms in eight countries in West Africa, especially alcohol-related diseases, mental health challenges, gender-based violence, and road accidents. The project will capacitate national alcohol policy alliances, which in time will contribute towards development, adoption and implementation of evidence-based alcohol control policies and legislation.</narrative>
  </description>
